.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-DOWNLOADS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-downloads
.Nd inspect and manage the admin download job queue
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad downloads
.Op Cm list | cancel Ar JOBID | remove Ar JOBID
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad downloads
shows the admin service's background download jobs across all states
.Pq active, waiting, delayed, failed, completed
and lets you cancel or remove individual jobs.
These are the jobs that fetch ZIM archives, embeddings, and other content.
.Pp
With no subcommand,
.Cm list
runs and prints each job's state, file type, source URL, progress, and any
failure reason.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm list
Print all download jobs in every state.
This is the default when no subcommand is given.
.It Cm cancel Ar JOBID
Cancel the running or queued job with the given
.Ar JOBID .
.It Cm remove Ar JOBID
Remove the job with the given
.Ar JOBID
from the queue.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad downloads
List every download job and its progress.
.It Ic nomad downloads cancel 42
Cancel job 42.
.It Ic nomad downloads remove 42
Remove job 42 from the queue.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-zim 1
